OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be dry with cloud clearing
OL,8,Fto allow some lengthy clear periods.
OL,9,FChilly in some rural glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAll parts will have a dry and
OL,12,Fwarm day with some good spells of
OL,13,Fsunshine.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,16,FCloudier on Tuesday with a chance of
OL,17,Fshowers. Some longer spells of rain
OL,18,Fare likely to extend north at times on
OL,19,FWednesday and Thursday.
